  final times = List<double>.filled(runs, 0);
  for (var i = 0; i < runs; i++) {
    times[i] = measure(() => wrapAnsiLine(line, width)) / 1000.0;
  }
  return times;
}
```

The pre-conflict HEAD version (from the earlier read of the file at head 53b2dcaa1) was:

```dart
double medianWrapMs(
